WEBVTT

00:01:59.574 --> 00:02:02.243
I myself love gaming.

00:02:02.243 --> 00:02:04.579
Not particularly good at it,
but I love it.

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.706
And I love the Formula 1 game.

00:02:06.747 --> 00:02:10.168
And that’s because I love real-world
Formula 1 racing.

00:02:10.209 --> 00:02:11.794
I'm going to show you a clip why.

00:02:11.836 --> 00:02:13.004
So this is Lando Norris,

00:02:13.045 --> 00:02:15.673
one of McLaren’s Formula 1 drivers.

00:02:15.715 --> 00:02:20.094
Multiple podium wins last year
driving the MCL35M --

00:02:20.136 --> 00:02:24.098
oh, MCL36, sorry --

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.267
the car for this year
in pre-season testing.

00:02:26.267 --> 00:02:27.643
Let's have a look at this.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:31.355
(Car engine revving)